    "updated_at": "2015-11-18T23:54:11Z",
    "body": "I believe you are correct that Blink makes it a no-op and returns default values if the the history reference is not linked with a page. \n\nI believe this came up earlier in [WHATWG discussion](https://lists.w3.org/Archives/Public/public-whatwg-archive/2015Jul/0062.html).  `window.history` object is supposed to be document-bound which if I understand it correctly should address this concern. I am not sure if this is defined in the spec.\n\n@annevk and @sicking may have some idea of how this should be introduced to spec of at all.\n\nSee:\n",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
