    "updated_at": "2015-11-23T20:58:20Z",
    "body": "ahaa, lovely, that is hidden in some other place than where it is defined what pushState() call or setting scrollRestoration do.\nSo if you click from interface definition's pushState, you get to the algorithm explaining what it does, and\nelsewhere in the text there is this conditional.\n\nBut thanks!\n Only editorial issue in the spec, and the behavior (throwing exception) is what I wanted :)\n",
